340:### Physical education, health and dance (boundaries)
341:
342:Students move only to show a music idea (conducting a meter, body percussion, clapping a pattern); they do not dance
343:(the samba de roda circle and the powwow are studied by watching), since dance is its own course and its motor skill
344:is physical education's (STANDARD.md 6). Changing voices are named as a normal change in the safety bullet only; why
345:voices change is health's to teach, and no music unit teaches it. No lean either way.
346:
347:### Social studies, grades 6 to 8
348:
349:The settings of works (Tuva, Senegal, Ethiopia, Lebanon, Brazil, China, Korea) are taught by each unit on its own work cards (bar
350:criterion 7), using social studies' sourcing habit of who, when, where and for what; the unit teaches the setting
351:it uses itself. No lean either way.
