3:Course `music-grades-6-to-8` (catalog id `music-6-8`), a band course for grade 6, grade 7 and grade 8, run as three years one after another (year 6, year 7, year 8). Draft frame, written 2026-11-25; the scope and sequence sets the days later, one year at a time, and each year's part of this file is that year's frame (data/courses.csv, "one frame per grade year").
