182:mu,10,mu-g10-invent,MU:Cr1.1.C.IIa; MU:Cr2.1.C.IIa,mu-g9-invent,mu-g11-invent,idea-bank,idea-bank,sonic event; memory; concept; text; sketch; expressive,,"Start from a memory, a text, a concept or a sound event, collect sound ideas that stand for it, and arrange many of them into a first expressive sketch with a stated aim. What changes: sources widen to memories, concepts and texts, where level 1 used a mood, image or story. Assessed by a sketch with a stated aim, scored on the Level 2 rubric. Level 2 opens with a review unit of at most 6 days that serves as placement."
